      "Hourly stats for target host derivation: target_host.txt = host-02. Using the loaded rows for host-02 (timestamps and cpu/mem):\n- 2024-03-01T00:05:00Z => hour 00:00:00 => cpu 55.0 mem 2048\n- 2024-03-01T01:00:00Z => hour 01:00:00 => cpu 60.0 mem 2100\n- 2024-03-01T03:00:00Z => hour 03:00:00 => cpu 88.0 mem 2150\n- 2024-03-01T05:00:00Z => hour 05:00:00 => cpu 92.0 mem 2300\n- 2024-03-01T06:00:00Z => two samples 2024-03-01T06:00:00Z (93.0, mem 2310) and 2024-03-01T06:10:00Z (30.0, mem 2000) => avg_cpu = (93.0+30.0)/2 = 61.5, max_mem_mb = 2310.\nHours with no host-02 data (e.g., 02:00) are omitted. Hour-start timestamps are truncated to the top of hour in UTC.",
