      "Rounding and types: Numeric averages are provided as JSON numbers. Averages were rounded to two decimal places where appropriate (top_hosts_by_avg_cpu) and hourly averages shown with reasonable precision (two decimals or one where exact). Timestamps are ISO8601 (UTC) strings, hour_start values truncated to top-of-hour.",
